    "detailed_description": "The Golden Time in high school is a RPG game.Players can operate characters to explore freely on campus, collect information and props, participate in multiple branch plots and achieve achievements. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame elements:<br />\r\n\u00b7Free exploration<br />\r\n\u00b7Multiple endings<br />\r\n\u00b7Information and items collecting<br />\r\n\u00b7Romantics<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play?<br />\r\nYou can chat with the characters to get information.<br />\r\nYou can join some organizations to achieve your goal.<br />\r\nYou can date with the girl you like.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game give you a chance to experience the life in student time again.<br />\r\nI hope to bring you fun in the process of simulating high school life.",
    "about_the_game": "The Golden Time in high school is a RPG game.Players can operate characters to explore freely on campus, collect information and props, participate in multiple branch plots and achieve achievements. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame elements:<br />\r\n\u00b7Free exploration<br />\r\n\u00b7Multiple endings<br />\r\n\u00b7Information and items collecting<br />\r\n\u00b7Romantics<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play?<br />\r\nYou can chat with the characters to get information.<br />\r\nYou can join some organizations to achieve your goal.<br />\r\nYou can date with the girl you like.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game give you a chance to experience the life in student time again.<br />\r\nI hope to bring you fun in the process of simulating high school life.",
    "short_description": "As a high school student of Shiguang high school, you will spend three years here. What kind of students that you will be? You can choose to study hard and get a good grade.You can choose to be an assistant to teacher to help with their daily affairs. Or just have a romantic date with somebody?",
